			"Message": "style(Mist): Combine component name and emoji in README header\n\nMerge the separate emoji table cells into their respective heading cells for both Mist and Land entries. The fog emoji (🌫️) now sits next to \"Mist\" with a narrow space (&#x2001;), and the landscape emoji (🏞️) sits next to \"Land\" in the link. Remove the standalone emoji columns and simplify the connector-cell content to a plain \"+\".\n\nThis reduces table column count and keeps the visual pairing of name + emoji together without changing semantic content.",
